Third-party software
--------------------
Lumiere Pro's installer bundles the Node.js runtime (MIT License, https://nodejs.org) and
production dependencies installed from npm and crates.io, each under its own license.

FFmpeg/ffprobe is NOT distributed with Lumiere Pro by default. Lumiere Pro runs the
`ffprobe` executable you install separately. FFmpeg is licensed under the LGPL or GPL
depending on how it was built (https://ffmpeg.org/legal.html). If you choose to bundle
an ffprobe binary into your own build, you are responsible for complying with its license.
